WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.669
Harry: From calorie
count to portion sizes,

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:03.937
we wanted to find out all the differences

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:06.740
between TGI Fridays in the UK and the US.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.408
This is "Food Wars."

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:13.913
Let's start with the starters.

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:15.615
Now, TGI Fridays in the UK and the US

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:16.983
both have lots of starter options.

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:17.851
So what we're gonna do is pick

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.652
the most popular ones and compare those.

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.654
First up, we have the mozzarella sticks.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:26.192
An order of these in the
UK contains four sticks.

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.762
In the US, our TGI
Fridays mozzarella sticks

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:31.598
come in an order of six. Six sticks.

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:34.901
Or you can get the platter,
which doubles that.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.236
12 sticks.

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:38.138
Harry: We're gonna weigh
three UK mozzarella sticks

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:40.206
to try and find the average weight.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.642
Hey, Harry, is that three sticks?

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:43.476
Thought we, ah ...

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:45.545
thought that order had four.
["Don't Be Suspicious" plays]

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:48.348
So, three mozzarella sticks
in the UK weighed 95 grams.

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:50.016
That means that each
individual mozzarella stick

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:52.252
weighed an average of 31.6 grams.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.655
Joe: Yes.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:58.858
So, six sticks is 260 grams.

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:03.730
So that's roughly
43-point-repeating-3 grams per stick.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:07.300
Now, pro tip, weigh your food,

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.535
then try one.

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.037
Mm.

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:14.007
TGI Fridays is running the
mozzarella cheese stick game.

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:17.377
They're running the moz stick game.

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:18.545
Mm.

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:20.113
The UK does have loaded potato skins,

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:22.148
but they're not currently
serving them due to the pandemic,

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:23.850
as they don't travel
very well for delivery.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:26.019
However, we were able to
find some in the store.

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:27.287
When they are available
in the restaurants,

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:30.056
they come in serving sizes of six or 12.

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:31.691
Well, we didn't have
that problem in the US,

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:33.026
or maybe we just don't care.

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:35.462
Either way, loaded potato
skins are totally available

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:38.598
at the US TGI Fridays, and
they come in two sizes.

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:39.599
You can get them in eight,

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:42.135
or you get the platty boy, which is 12.

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:45.238
Chicken wings in the UK
come in two portion sizes.

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:48.675
As a single portion of three wings,

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:50.743
or as a sharing portion,

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:54.781
which is six wings.

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:57.784
♪ Chicken wing, chicken wing ♪

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:00.820
Hey, Harry, when I said
to compare the wings

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.890
between the US and the
UK, I meant these wings.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.325
Maybe it's cultural differences,

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:07.393
or maybe I just read the menu wrong.

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:08.495
Anyway!

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:10.864
In the US, our wings
come in an order of 10,

00:02:10.864 --> 00:02:14.367
or you can get a platter
of either 30 or 50 wings.

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:15.201
Hell yeah, dude.

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:17.737
I wanna eat every single
one of these wings.

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:19.038
If you like your chicken off the bone,

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:21.007
you can also get boneless
wings at TGI Fridays,

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:22.609
in both the UK and the US.

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:24.144
Here they come in two portion sizes,

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:26.279
as a single, which is 7 ounces,

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:29.115
or as a sharing size, which is 14 ounces.

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:30.783
In the US, our TGI Fridays

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:32.452
offer boneless wings by ounces.

00:02:32.452 --> 00:02:35.021
You can get 10 ounces, 40 ounces,

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:38.191
or a platter of 80 ounces.

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:40.260
Look at this. You have no
idea how good this smells.

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:44.764
That is so good!

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:46.599
How are they so good?

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.568
The ribs in the UK come in two sizes,

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:51.037
as a half rack, or as a full rack.

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:54.541
And both come in either a
legendary or a barbecue glaze.

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:56.109
Our ribs in the US also come in

00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:58.545
a half slab or a full slab.

00:02:58.545 --> 00:02:59.946
We're gonna weigh our large portion to see

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:01.981
who out of me or Joe has the biggest rack.

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:03.750
[ba-dum tish]

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:08.721
So, a large rack of ribs in the
UK came to around 366 grams.

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:11.491
Bunch of children over there.

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:13.092
"Joe's rack."

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:14.327
Grow up!

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:15.528
All right, here we go.

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:17.463
Zoop!

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:19.766
Ooh, this guy's already falling apart.

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:22.769
Tender.

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:26.806
And a full slab in the
US is almost 600 grams.

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:27.807
How do you like that?

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:29.642
I got the bigger rack.

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:30.510
Most meals in the UK

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:32.212
come with a side of fries by default.

00:03:32.212 --> 00:03:33.813
So we're gonna weigh a
regular portion of fries

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:35.448
to see what it comes to.

00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:37.217
Joe: Yikes, ours is only 120.

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:41.120
120 for a side of fries in the US. Hm.

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:45.391
Here is everything you
will only find on the menu

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:47.260
at a UK TGI Fridays.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:49.829
And this is everything
you can get in the US

00:03:49.829 --> 00:03:52.498
and not the UK at a TGI Fridays.

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:53.700
Let's start with some appetizers.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.602
For example, over here, we have these,

00:03:55.602 --> 00:03:57.870
which are lightly spiced shrimp.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.572
They're just shrimp
which are breaded, fried,

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:01.174
and, I presume, lightly spiced.

00:04:01.174 --> 00:04:02.475
It's slightly strange that
they've been referred to

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:03.509
as shrimp on the menu here,

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:06.412
as it's more common in the
UK to refer to them as prawn.

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:08.481
It seems like TGI Fridays
UK have sided with

00:04:08.481 --> 00:04:11.017
their American overlord,
which is disappointing.

00:04:11.017 --> 00:04:12.518
Then we have two garlic bread options.

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:14.354
This is a garlic ciabatta,

00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:17.056
and then this one is a
garlic ciabatta with cheese.

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:19.726
Pot stickers.

00:04:19.726 --> 00:04:21.261
These things are so good, dude.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:28.134
They're in no way authentic to
what a pot sticker should be.

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:31.070
But in a category all of its
own, those are pretty good.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.772
The spinach and artichoke dip.

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:36.242
This is, like, classic TGI Fridays, right?

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:39.512
You know what we got in the
US you don't got in the UK?

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:41.514
Wing roulette.

00:04:41.514 --> 00:04:43.149
So, what that means is you can get,

00:04:43.149 --> 00:04:44.884
I think, what looks like nine or 10 wings

00:04:44.884 --> 00:04:46.586
and three different sauces,

00:04:46.586 --> 00:04:48.554
but you can't tell, maybe
you get a really spicy one,

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:49.956
maybe you get a mild one, you don't know.

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:51.991
Do you wanna play wing
roulette with me, Conner?

00:04:52.592 --> 00:04:53.626
There, you can take it with the paper.

00:04:53.626 --> 00:04:54.594
But wait until I get mine.

00:04:54.594 --> 00:04:55.495
Conner: Got it.

00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:56.996
OK. All right, buddy. Ready?

00:04:56.996 --> 00:04:58.431
Conner: Ready.

00:04:58.431 --> 00:04:59.265
Wing roulette.

00:04:59.265 --> 00:05:00.500
One, two, three.

00:05:05.505 --> 00:05:07.006
I think I might've gotten the spicy one.

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:08.274
Ooh.

00:05:08.274 --> 00:05:09.242
Uh-oh.

00:05:11.377 --> 00:05:13.513
Yeah, I think I got the atomic one.

00:05:13.513 --> 00:05:14.447
Yeah, dude.

00:05:14.447 --> 00:05:15.281
That's fun.

00:05:15.281 --> 00:05:16.115
Isn't that fun?

00:05:16.115 --> 00:05:17.216
[laughing]

00:05:17.216 --> 00:05:21.054
It's fun to torture your
friends when you're out eating.

00:05:21.054 --> 00:05:22.889
We have two exclusive
chicken sandwich options.

00:05:22.889 --> 00:05:24.057
For example, this one,

00:05:24.057 --> 00:05:26.592
which is the Californian
chicken club sandwich.

00:05:26.592 --> 00:05:27.560
And then this one over here,

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:30.029
which is the Louisiana Hot Mess sandwich.

00:05:30.029 --> 00:05:31.431
Next up, we've got some hot dogs.

00:05:31.431 --> 00:05:33.466
This is the classic American hot dog.

00:05:33.466 --> 00:05:34.701
There's really not that
much to say about it

00:05:34.701 --> 00:05:36.202
because it is just a hot dog on a bun.

00:05:36.202 --> 00:05:37.637
Although Joe will be excited to learn

00:05:37.637 --> 00:05:39.339
that it's not sliced in half.

00:05:39.339 --> 00:05:42.275
It's a burger with cheese fries on it.

00:05:42.275 --> 00:05:44.477
Look -- [laughs]

00:05:44.477 --> 00:05:45.912
Look at this thing.

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:47.513
I gotta know. I have to know.

00:05:52.719 --> 00:05:54.654
This is good, dude.

00:05:54.654 --> 00:05:56.155
I would get this at TGI Fridays.

00:05:56.155 --> 00:05:57.390
I'm surprised by how good this is.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:01.661
So, we got a signature
whiskey-glaze flat iron steak.

00:06:01.661 --> 00:06:03.463
Bet that's the glaze sauce right there.

00:06:03.463 --> 00:06:05.465
And then we got the New York strip.

00:06:05.465 --> 00:06:08.568
The Dragon-Glaze Salmon, you
got a shot of this before.

00:06:08.568 --> 00:06:09.602
You know what I noticed?

00:06:09.602 --> 00:06:12.839
They have this sizzling
chicken and cheese dish.

00:06:12.839 --> 00:06:14.474
So I'm assuming

00:06:14.474 --> 00:06:17.076
it goes through the dining
room sizzling on the plate.

00:06:17.076 --> 00:06:21.214
Because, I noticed TGI
Fridays does not have fajitas.

00:06:21.214 --> 00:06:22.415
I'm surprised by that.

00:06:22.415 --> 00:06:25.251
So if your US TGI Fridays
has fajitas, let me know.

00:06:25.251 --> 00:06:26.919
'Cause I didn't see them on our menu,

00:06:26.919 --> 00:06:29.021
and I didn't see them
on several other menus.

00:06:29.021 --> 00:06:31.491
This is the Philly cheesesteak burger.

00:06:31.491 --> 00:06:32.759
I don't know.

00:06:32.759 --> 00:06:34.394
Oh, man, this thing's super messy.

00:06:35.828 --> 00:06:38.498
They got the peppers, the
onions, the melted cheese,

00:06:39.532 --> 00:06:44.170
and what appears to be shredded beef,

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.205
and all on top of a burger.

00:06:47.707 --> 00:06:49.442
No, thanks.

00:06:49.442 --> 00:06:50.710
We have three sides which it looks like

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:52.111
you guys can't get in America.

00:06:52.111 --> 00:06:53.346
We'll start with these ones from the back,

00:06:53.346 --> 00:06:55.548
which are the Cajun spiced onion rings.

00:06:55.548 --> 00:06:57.016
While you guys can get onion rings,

00:06:57.016 --> 00:06:57.950
I thought it was worth pointing out

00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.285
that these ones are Cajun spiced,

00:06:59.285 --> 00:07:01.120
and they're only ones
available on the UK menu.

00:07:01.988 --> 00:07:03.990
[onion ring crunching]

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:06.092
Next up, we've got corn on the cob,

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:07.527
which comes served with butter

00:07:07.527 --> 00:07:10.163
and what looks to be even
more Cajun seasoning.

00:07:10.163 --> 00:07:11.964
And then, once again, we
have what is fast becoming

00:07:11.964 --> 00:07:13.566
my archnemesis on this show,

00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:15.401
which is the sweet potato fry.

00:07:15.401 --> 00:07:17.136
Those of you who've
watched episodes before

00:07:17.136 --> 00:07:18.938
will probably know that
I'm not the biggest fan

00:07:18.938 --> 00:07:20.573
of sweet potato fries for this reason.

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:22.408
They go super soggy.

00:07:22.408 --> 00:07:23.876
They are bland.

00:07:23.876 --> 00:07:25.611
They are not as good as regular fries.

00:07:25.611 --> 00:07:27.580
And they cost more. Stop ordering them.

00:07:29.148 --> 00:07:31.317
Broccoli and cheddar soup.

00:07:35.121 --> 00:07:37.190
Yo, that's -- oh, man.

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:38.524
That's been sitting for a while.

00:07:38.524 --> 00:07:40.526
That broccoli odor just hit me.

00:07:41.394 --> 00:07:44.030
Cheddar mac and cheese, a classic side.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.364
Then there's also a kid's menu hot dog,

00:07:45.364 --> 00:07:46.432
which is smaller in size

00:07:46.432 --> 00:07:48.401
but also gives you the
option to add cheese,

00:07:48.401 --> 00:07:50.536
which, personally, not
convinced is the best move,

00:07:50.536 --> 00:07:51.804
but you do you.

00:07:51.804 --> 00:07:53.840
Something for the kids.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:55.741
Get sliders and fries,

00:07:55.741 --> 00:07:56.576
mac and cheese.

00:07:56.576 --> 00:07:58.277
What youngster doesn't
like mac and cheese?

00:07:58.277 --> 00:07:59.412
Come on, now.

00:07:59.412 --> 00:08:02.548
And pasta, one with the marinara.

00:08:02.548 --> 00:08:05.585
And it comes with a side of either fries

00:08:05.585 --> 00:08:07.653
or probably some veggies
or fruit, I don't know.

00:08:07.653 --> 00:08:10.022
We also have milkshakes
at TGI Fridays in the UK.

00:08:10.022 --> 00:08:11.958
We've got two here,
which are the Oreo shake

00:08:11.958 --> 00:08:13.526
and the chocolate shake.

00:08:13.526 --> 00:08:15.828
Fridays is known for
their signature drinks,

00:08:15.828 --> 00:08:17.663
their signature margs.

00:08:17.663 --> 00:08:21.167
So you can get, at TGI
Fridays in the US at least,

00:08:21.167 --> 00:08:24.770
your margs to go in a single beverage,

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:29.775
or 64 fluid ounces of Fridays' margarita.

00:08:29.775 --> 00:08:30.710
Hell yeah, dude.

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:32.512
You know I'm drinking all this tonight.

00:08:32.512 --> 00:08:34.981
Thank you, Fridays.

00:08:34.981 --> 00:08:36.315
Now, the one dessert
option we were actually

00:08:36.315 --> 00:08:38.150
able to pick up today was this,

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:41.087
the Chocolate Fudge Fixation cake.

00:08:41.087 --> 00:08:43.189
It's a very indulgent-looking
chocolate cake

00:08:43.189 --> 00:08:45.358
with some chocolate icing,
and also what looks like

00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:47.560
a healthy layer of fudge in the middle.

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:50.863
You can get this really
fun slice of rainbow cake

00:08:50.863 --> 00:08:53.232
from, I think it's Carlo's
Bakery rainbow cake.

00:08:53.232 --> 00:08:54.834
Look at that, isn't that fun?

00:08:54.834 --> 00:08:55.668
That's fun.

00:08:55.668 --> 00:08:59.672
Cinnabon caramel pecan
slice of cheesecake.

00:08:59.672 --> 00:09:02.241
Dude, this, I bet, is amazing.

00:09:02.241 --> 00:09:04.477
And I gotta give it up to TGI Fridays.

00:09:04.477 --> 00:09:07.246
They were nice enough
that each slice of cake

00:09:07.246 --> 00:09:08.848
comes with a scoop of ice cream.

00:09:09.882 --> 00:09:10.816
It's been a minute.

00:09:11.951 --> 00:09:14.887
So imagine a scoop of ice
cream with sprinkles in this.

00:09:14.887 --> 00:09:17.657
Sorry, guys. We don't have a freezer.

00:09:17.657 --> 00:09:19.158
Now, usually we'd have
a lot more to show you,

00:09:19.158 --> 00:09:20.159
but because of the pandemic,

00:09:20.159 --> 00:09:22.328
TGI Fridays in the UK have
reduced their operations.

00:09:22.328 --> 00:09:23.963
So here's what you would
normally be able to find

00:09:23.963 --> 00:09:25.932
on top of what we've already shown you.

00:09:25.932 --> 00:09:28.968
Avocado hummus, cheesy
nachos, a rib eye steak,

00:09:28.968 --> 00:09:32.371
a Texan steak, garlic
chicken, king prawn linguine,

00:09:32.371 --> 00:09:35.207
teriyaki salmon, fajitas, a Warrior burger

00:09:35.207 --> 00:09:37.043
with mozzarella sticks in the burger,

00:09:37.043 --> 00:09:40.112
loaded Warrior fries, loaded Mario fries,

00:09:40.112 --> 00:09:42.949
rosti potato fries, a s'mores sundae,

00:09:42.949 --> 00:09:45.418
a cookie dough sundae,
a New York cheesecake,

00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:47.720
fresh fruit and orange sorbet sundae,

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:49.889
and then, on the kid's menu,
you can get fish fingers,

00:09:49.889 --> 00:09:52.658
chicken burgers, boneless
bites, tomato tubes,

00:09:52.658 --> 00:09:54.827
chicken wrap, vegan meatball penne,

00:09:54.827 --> 00:09:56.796
veggie burgers, create your own dessert,

00:09:56.796 --> 00:09:58.898
Chilly Billy ice lolly, and a fruit cup.

00:10:02.468 --> 00:10:03.970
Unfortunately, TGI Fridays in the UK

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:05.738
doesn't disclose its
nutritional information.

00:10:05.738 --> 00:10:06.973
We were able to find some of it,

00:10:06.973 --> 00:10:09.241
but that was through third-party
websites and articles.

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:11.577
For example, in the UK we
found that one mozzarella stick

00:10:11.577 --> 00:10:14.347
contains 110 calories, 6 grams of fat,

00:10:14.347 --> 00:10:16.649
7 grams of carbs, and 4 grams of protein,

00:10:16.649 --> 00:10:18.551
bringing the total for a side
order of mozzarella sticks

00:10:18.551 --> 00:10:20.853
to 440 calories.

00:10:20.853 --> 00:10:23.522
We did get our nutrition
information from TGI Fridays,

00:10:23.522 --> 00:10:26.559
and a US order of mozzarella sticks

00:10:26.559 --> 00:10:28.661
are 840 calories,

